cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OverlapTools, please cite it as below."
title: "OverlapTools"
abstract: "Pipeline to classify, score and evaluate ORFs that overlap known genes: ORF classification against a genome annotation, gene-likeness scores (Prodigal, Balrog, PGAP, Bakta), taxonomy-restricted tBLASTn homolog search, codon alignments, RNAcode and OLGenie."
authors:
